        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard Patna → Dharamshala move covers roughly 850 km and usually takes 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic, weather in the Himalayan foothills, and any special handling requirements. Our dedicated multi‑axle trucks operate round‑the‑clock, and real‑time GPS tracking keeps you informed throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for an intercity shift from Patna to Dharamshala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients must provide a valid government‑issued ID, original GST invoice (if applicable), a signed service agreement, and a copy of the e‑Way bill for goods exceeding ₹50,000. For vehicle transport, registration certificate, insurance copy, and a No‑Objection Certificate are also needed. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to ensure smooth customs‑free transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my vehicle fully insured while being transported from Patna to Dharamshala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every car, bike, or scooter shipped on our Patna‑Dharamshala route is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that offers 100 % declared‑value coverage. In addition, we provide a detailed insurance certificate before loading, and any claim is processed within 48 hours in coordination with the insurer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my household goods in real time during the Patna‑Dharamshala move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our 120+ owned container trucks are equipped with satellite‑based GPS devices that feed live location data to a secure client portal. You can view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations instantly, giving you complete visibility and peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the price of Packers And Movers Patna To Dharamshala services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is shaped by distance (per‑km rate), volume and weight of items, type of vehicle required, special handling for fragile or high‑value goods, and any additional services such as temporary storage or expedited delivery. Seasonal traffic, fuel surcharge, and insurance coverage also play a role, all of which are transparently itemized in our tariff chart.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect fragile items when moving to the hilly terrain of Dharamshala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer protection system includes polythene wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, double‑wall corrugated sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom‑built wooden crates for delicate pieces. For the mountainous stretch, we use hydraulic loading ramps and anti‑vibration mounts, ensuring that glass, artwork, and temple idols arrive intact despite road gradients.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special regulations for moving institutional or NGO assets from Patna to Dharamshala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Institutional moves must comply with the Indian Banks Association (IBA) mover code and may require additional clearance from local municipal bodies in Dharamshala. We handle all statutory paperwork, including permission letters and inventory declarations, and our ISO‑9001:2015 certified processes guarantee that large‑scale assets are shifted safely and on schedule.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
